msgstr "Administrator hisobini yaratish"

msgid "After registering, you'll verify your phone number via Telegram before you can log in."
msgstr "Ro'yxatdan o'tgach, tizimga kirishdan oldin telefon raqamingizni Telegram orqali tasdiqlashingiz kerak."

